decision_conditions:
Condition : 17 - Units 1-4 shall only be used for Class B2 and/or Class B8 and/or Class B8 with ancillary showroom and/or the following sui generis uses:
a.      storage, distribution and sale of tiles and floor coverings, bathroom and kitchen furniture and fittings and other building materials;
b.      machinery, tool and plant hire;
c.      auto centres involving fitting and associated sale of tyres and car parts (including MOT);
d.      plumbers and builders merchants.
